# Protein Backbone RMSD

This directory contains protein backbone root-mean-square deviation (RMSD) data from the MD simulations of GG1-S, GG1-R, GG2-S, GG2-R, GGM-S, and GGM-R.
The OPJU files can be opened directly in Origin to view the RMSD data and plots.

RMSD values describe structural deviations from the reference structure after alignment of the protein backbone atoms.

## Data Format

- Time: (ns)
- RMSD: angstroms (Å)

File names identify the corresponding enzyme–substrate complex.
